cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Uso de Inteligência Artificial na Detecção de Ataques de Phishing"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark of nine phishing detection models, classical and
  character-level neural, evaluated within dataset and across datasets under one
  shared protocol, to measure how much of a detector's reported accuracy survives
  a corpus it has never seen.
type: software
authors:
